#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit-cutting tutorials from the Qiskit addon's GitHub repository, and where IBM Quantum's documentation covers the other addons."
msgstr "Tutoriels de découpage de circuit issus du dépôt GitHub de l'addon Qiskit, et où la documentation d'IBM Quantum couvre les autres addons."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

