#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques.\n"
msgstr "Les [Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) sont des packages d'extension officiels qui fournissent des algorithmes et des techniques de calcul quantique spécialisés.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials here {#tutorials-here}"
msgstr "Tutoriels disponibles ici {#tutorials-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width by cutting gates, and find cuts automatically |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Réduire la largeur d'un circuit en découpant des portes, et trouver automatiquement les coupes |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's documentation no longer has guides for this addon, and no IBM tutorial covers these two. They come from the addon's GitHub repository and may be outdated. They can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "La documentation d'IBM Quantum n'a plus de guides pour cet addon, et aucun tutoriel IBM ne couvre ces deux-là. Ils proviennent du dépôt GitHub de l'addon et peuvent être obsolètes. Ils peuvent être exécutés directement dans ton navigateur avec Binder, ou sur ton propre serveur Jupyter.\n"

